# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC (studiolabsoftware-code/studiolab-growth-onboarding).
#
# outputs/ and calculators/ are working folders. They hold confidential
# pricing, margin workings and commercial modelling for named studios, so the
# default is DENY: nothing new in them is committed unless someone forces it.
# Already-tracked files in these folders are unaffected and keep working
# normally. Nothing is deleted, it just stays local.
#
# To publish one on purpose, and only after checking it carries no client
# name, price, margin or contact detail:  git add -f <path>
#
# This used to be a list of file extensions (csv, docx, pdf, pptx, xlsx),
# which left every .md, .html and .png unprotected. On 2026-09-04 that gap had
# 45 untracked internal files sitting one `git add -A` away from publication,
# including a document headed "Confidential" with the full AU and US plan
# pricing. Do not narrow this back to an extension list.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

outputs/
calculators/

# Scratch and local tooling state: never published, nothing here is tracked today.
tmp/
ruvector.db
.swarm/
.playwright-mcp/
